    "These packages use different Registries. Install them in separate batches so each source can be confirmed.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"These packages use different Registries. Install them in separate batches so each source can be confirmed."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"这些软件包使用不同的 Registry。请分批安装，以便分别确认来源。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這些套件使用不同的 Registry。請分批安裝，以便分別確認來源。"}}}},
